==English==

===Etymology===
{{prefix|super|continent|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A very large [[continent]] that [[split]] into smaller ones in the [[earth|Earth]]’s [[geologic]] past.
# A modern [[landmass]] composed of multiple continents, i.e. [[Afro-Eurasia]] or the [[Americas]]. (Compare {{m|en|subcontinent}}).

